@startuml
actor "Operator" as Operator
participant "MES" as MES
participant "DB Cache" as DBCache
participant "MES DB" as DB

Operator -> MES: 1. Update order status (e.g., PUT /order/{order_id})
MES -> DBCache: 2. Write order update (Write-Through)
DBCache -> DB: 3. Update order in DB
DB -> DB: 4. Update order data
DB -> DBCache: 5. Confirm update
DBCache -> DBCache: 6. Update cache for {order_id}
DBCache -> MES: 7. Confirm order update
MES -> Operator: 8. Show success message

@enduml